---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for recoverBehavior. Interpret prose requirements, bug reports, and relevant discussion to identify observable behavior, preconditions, and exclusions. Separate implementation suggestions from requirements and preserve ambiguous expectations for owner resolution before encoding them as tests. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
